// Hand-authored Pine v5 fixture — covers the most common indicator shape:
// indicator() directive (study() in v5) + a single ta.* call + plot().
//
// Per PRD §2.1: this file was written from scratch by the OpenBB Pine team.
// No source was copied from TradingView's website or community library.
//
// Migration target: every line is rewritten by ONE of the V5_REWRITES
// entries — study() → indicator(), pragma rewrite. The v6 hand-translation
// lives at simple_sma.v6.pine and the test asserts the two compile to
// IR with the same shape.
//@version=5
study("Simple SMA", overlay=true)
length = input.int(20, minval=1)
basis = ta.sma(close, length)
plot(basis, color=color.blue, transp=20)
